## Azure Deployment

The project is designed to deploy to three Azure services:

| Service | Hosts | Tier |
|---|---|---|
| Azure Static Web Apps | Angular frontend | Free |
| Azure App Service (Linux container) | .NET API | B1 |
| Azure SQL Database | SQL Server | Basic |

### GitHub Secrets Required

Before the CI/CD pipelines can run, add these secrets to your GitHub repository  
(**Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions**):

| Secret | How to get it |
|---|---|
| `AZURE_STATIC_WEB_APPS_API_TOKEN` | Azure Portal → Static Web App → Manage deployment token |
| `ACR_LOGIN_SERVER` | Azure Container Registry → Overview (e.g. `myregistry.azurecr.io`) |
| `ACR_USERNAME` | Azure Container Registry → Access keys |
| `ACR_PASSWORD` | Azure Container Registry → Access keys |
| `AZURE_APP_SERVICE_NAME` | Name of your App Service resource |
| `AZURE_APP_SERVICE_PUBLISH_PROFILE` | App Service → Overview → Download publish profile |

### App Service Environment Variables

Set these in **App Service → Configuration → Application settings**:

```
ASPNETCORE_ENVIRONMENT              = Production
ConnectionStrings__DefaultConnection = Server=tcp:<server>.database.windows.net,1433;Database=DevOpsMonitoringDb;User Id=<user>;Password=<password>;TrustServerCertificate=False;Encrypt=True
CORS_ORIGINS                        = https://<your-app>.azurestaticapps.net
```

### CI/CD Pipelines

| Workflow | Trigger | Action |
|---|---|---|
| `deploy-frontend.yml` | Push to `main` with changes in `monitoring-dashboard/` | Build Angular → deploy to Static Web Apps |
| `deploy-api.yml` | Push to `main` with changes in `Monitoring.Api/` | Build Docker image → push to ACR → deploy to App Service |

